#: src/pages.py:2244
msgid "Installing an input method requires an Internet connection."
msgstr "Za instaliranje načina unosa potrebna je internetska veza."

#: src/pages.py:2255
msgid ""
"No Internet connection. Input methods cannot be installed. You can install "
"them later when connected."
msgstr ""
"Nema internetske veze. Načine unosa možete instalirati poslije, kad se "
"povežete s internetom."

#: src/pages.py:7174
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"A real installation will create a machine-local MOK. After reboot, choose "
"Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes in MOKManager and enter password 123456."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Stvarna instalacija izradit će MOK za ovo računalo. Nakon ponovnog "
"pokretanja u MOKManageru odaberite Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes i unesite "
"lozinku 123456."

#: src/pages.py:6191
msgid "; sudo does not require a password"
msgstr "; sudo ne traži lozinku"

#: src/pages.py:6193
msgid "; sudo requires the account password"
msgstr "; sudo traži lozinku računa"

#: src/pages.py:160
msgid ""
"A partition on this disk is mounted. Unmount it and rescan storage before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Na ovom je disku montirana particija. Odmontirajte je i ponovno pregledajte "
"diskove prije nastavka."

#: src/pages.py:3241
msgid "ALL DATA on {disk} will be permanently erased."
msgstr "SVI PODACI na disku {disk} bit će trajno izbrisani."

#: src/pages.py:6188
msgid "Account security"
msgstr "Sigurnost računa"

#: src/pages.py:4066
msgid "Advanced Storage"
msgstr "Napredne postavke pohrane"

#: src/pages.py:195
msgid ""
"After changing partitions or unmounting a volume, rescan storage and select "
"the target again."
msgstr ""
"Nakon promjene particija ili odmontiranja volumena ponovno pregledajte "
"diskove i odaberite odredište."

#: src/pages.py:7042
msgid ""
"After restart, MOKManager will open. Choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes, "
"then enter password 123456."
msgstr ""
"Nakon ponovnog pokretanja otvorit će se MOKManager. Odaberite Enroll MOK → "
"Continue → Yes pa unesite lozinku 123456."

#: src/pages.py:6636
msgid ""
"All partitions and data on {disk} will be destroyed.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Sve particije i podaci na disku {disk} bit će izbrisani.\n"
"\n"

#: src/pages.py:186
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you may explicitly select one entire partition to erase. "
"Everything in that selected partition will be destroyed; it is never "
"selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Možete i izričito odabrati cijelu jednu particiju za brisanje. Sav sadržaj "
"te particije bit će izbrisan. Instalacijski program nikada je neće odabrati "
"automatski."

